\paragraph{Per-task correlation structure.}
The internal strategy dies in 42.9\% of episodes versus 16.3\% for deterministic (2.6$\times$). Per-task death rate differential correlates with $\Delta_{\text{full}}$ ($r = 0.97$, $p < 10^{-6}$; Figure~\ref{fig:decomposition})

